  Sentences:
  - Text: Phew, so far so good.
    emotion: 0
    name: 
    sound: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 86c0c0a5e3a75ff42a0030803f8a4275, type: 3}
  - Text: I've got quite a bit of gold, but it's not enough.
    emotion: 0
    name: 
    sound: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 86c0c0a5e3a75ff42a0030803f8a4275, type: 3}
  - Text: Hmm? A sword in the ground? I wonder who left it here.
    emotion: 2
    name: 
    sound: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 86c0c0a5e3a75ff42a0030803f8a4275, type: 3}
  - Text: I'm gonna try pulling it out of the ground.
    emotion: 0
    name: 
    sound: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 86c0c0a5e3a75ff42a0030803f8a4275, type: 3}
  - Text: Don't mind if I do!
    emotion: 1
    name: 
    sound: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 86c0c0a5e3a75ff42a0030803f8a4275, type: 3}
